{{知识点名称}}写作考试要求{{知识点内容}}根据题目和提纲写短文，字数150-200字，时间30分钟，分值15分。▮{{知识点名称}}写作常见题型{{知识点内容}}现象解释型（描述现象→分析原因→给出建议）；对比观点型（引出话题→正方→反方→我的看法）；问题解决型（提出问题→分析影响→解决方案）；图表作文型（描述图表→分析原因→预测趋势）；名言警句型（解释名言→举例论证→总结升华）。▮{{知识点名称}}写作开头段模板{{知识点内容}}With the rapid development of..., the issue of...has aroused wide concern. / It is universally acknowledged that...plays a crucial role in... / In recent years, there has been a growing trend of... / The proverb/quote "..." reminds us that...▮{{知识点名称}}写作主体段模板{{知识点内容}}There are several reasons accounting for this phenomenon. / First and foremost...Furthermore...Last but not least... / On the one hand...On the other hand... / A case in point is... / According to a recent survey/study...▮{{知识点名称}}写作结尾段模板{{知识点内容}}In conclusion/To sum up/All in all... / Taking all these factors into consideration... / It is high time that we took action to... / Only by doing...can we...▮{{知识点名称}}高分强调句型{{知识点内容}}It is...that/who... / What I want to emphasize is that... / Nothing is more important than...▮{{知识点名称}}高分倒装句型{{知识点内容}}Not only...but also... / Only by doing...can we... / So...that... / Not until...did we...▮{{知识点名称}}高分虚拟语气句型{{知识点内容}}If I were you, I would... / It is essential that...should... / I wish I could...▮{{知识点名称}}高分被动句型{{知识点内容}}It is widely believed/accepted/acknowledged that... / More attention should be paid to... / Measures should be taken to...▮{{知识点名称}}高级词汇替换{{知识点内容}}important→crucial/vital/significant/essential；think→maintain/contend/assert/argue；more and more→an increasing number of/a growing number of；very→extremely/exceedingly/remarkably；good→excellent/outstanding/exceptional；bad→adverse/detrimental/deleterious。▮{{知识点名称}}写作常见错误{{知识点内容}}主谓不一致、时态混乱、冠词缺失、介词误用、句子碎片、中式英语、词汇重复、逻辑不清。